{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fdb3fe96382f9a5c6c3821ccb9243461535d52b3942b736574f6101978fd72f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000035:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5a3d542846412ea239254074173503567d0c83885a7d2404feddebbaebcbb54",
      "text": "感谢祭当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecc935ccf4b6620a1e41412407b1bddbbb76f2b45f78d2d14cecbab39936c68c",
      "text": "欢迎来到感谢祭。怀揣着平日里的谢意，\n今天我也会用我的方式来招待大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe892aa6d128272b73ab9c40c62a56e62ffcee85513c6b536f9c96276ef24039",
      "text": "这道料理好好吃……！\n请问用的是什么酱汁呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bb251168c458c6ffdb63df1f4417cc8038693e207acc41fe969470fe8e5d624",
      "text": "（都筑把料理相关的事情都记住了吗。\n……我应该多向他交代一些的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1167714f3f782637d12d56286c2cbc98d5c7cc8ee812060396b41de655a4d73",
      "text": "（好，这里由我去吧。\n只留都筑一个人让人放心不下……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1858035959463aee793a7fb88052a5dcbffc7dfab51ff2ff9c910d3c29dadb2",
      "text": "不好意思！饮品的种类好多，\n请问有什么推荐的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ecfb6c8d457a0563a5d926b3ebb5f75aa698b219c5161a6fa232037c7613b9d",
      "text": "好、好的。请稍等片刻。\n今天的推荐是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000129:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7255370aab2488af239f90056754e18d8fc5080c60b8f9a19f76fc347cec96ea",
      "text": "（结果完全没能帮上都筑的忙……\n看来是我多虑了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:633f938b94083af7d9dd47f9d288df902bcb4041d9e35356bff426cd4b900f29",
      "text": "都筑。我刚才听到您的说明了。\n讲得非常精彩……坦白说让我大吃一惊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:664cd9842d5615a6da3a8819fb5f155dad0dda39c399861a221eb9fe9c48d442",
      "text": "……在和Cafe Parade的大家的练习中，\n我意识到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:808f198dd6937937cdc8c6ac5f173a536b550a499f2d343215048b9bf6a5fa55",
      "text": "能够注入自己的心意……注入感谢之情的\n料理，是多么美妙的作品啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cba92f036d5494b5a3526d5b0f70c2b2804995dc3eebe01d54c67986a379089",
      "text": "于是我就变得更想去了解他们的作品了……\n虽然只是按照我自己的方式学习了一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30a16f00935976eade6996db9245b768486e9506abd0e9361e11571491f1d9c5",
      "text": "我多多少少，有帮上感谢祭的忙吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45075c8631afba3e73860eb751a66518f1285d2e211c0cf4500ba41360f15aee",
      "text": "嗯！正是多亏了都筑的解说，\n料理肯定变得更加美味了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_g:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150bb1a6a5584f6d62b7e923159a6f4b973ed12cdea6dfe8f193daa238355fa1",
      "text": "呵呵，能这样就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
